## Interface: 16001
## Title: |cff33ff99Quest Chain Tip|r
## Title-zhCN: |cff33ff99任务链提示|r
## Notes: Shows the whole quest chain for any quest - including ones you have already accepted. Hold Shift on the world map for a full chain window: objectives, rewards, description, where to accept / hand in, dungeon flag.
## Notes-zhCN: 任意任务（含已接取）都能看整条任务链。在世界地图上按住 Shift 弹出窗口，展示整条任务链的完成条件/奖励/详情/接取与交付地点/是否副本。
